    <apiVersion>62.0</apiVersion>
    <description>When Salesforce flags an outbound email as bounced, tell the person who sent it. The bounce is recorded silently on the EmailMessage, so without this a request for documents can bounce off a mistyped address while the sender waits for an upload that can never arrive.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>Email: Notify Sender Of Bounce {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Email: Notify Sender Of Bounce</label>
